  "boundary": "This intake plan governs durable admission of independently reviewed exact-source Section 48 evidence for all 25 dev.47 v1.3 lanes. It permits incremental accepted evidence records while keeping inventory completeness fail-closed. Complete evidence inventory can make the packet ready for a separate governed Section 48 acceptance review, but cannot itself establish Section 48 acceptance, V1.7.1 acceptance, lifecycle promotion, consumer eligibility, deployment, publication, or production authority."
